; User-facing OCaml library for calling into Java from OCaml.
; Users [open Java] or reference [Java.Unsafe] to declare FFI
; primitives. The [external] declarations here have primitive names of
; the form "java:<op>:<class>:<member>:<descriptor>", recognised by
; the java_of_ocaml backend's [Jvm_generate.emit_java_ffi].

(library
 (name java_of_ocaml_runtime)
 (public_name java_of_ocaml.runtime)
 (wrapped false))
